# Varuna Point Remade's fuel-spill gallery without a suit (CIPlay varuna_point_remade_acid, 11-12 w13; in a test world 'CI ...'; offline-written, NOT yet run).
# Points as in its recipe: the junction at -18 -69.6 (sign vpfuelwarn at -16 -68.2, suit box at -17.2 -68.6), the gallery to
# -22 -63 and its chamber at -22.6 -61.8 (zone vp_fuelspill r 3.2, safe=suit). Floor taken as 5.6 m: a GUESS for a Raft surface probe.
island Varuna Point Remade keep
offset -0.7903 -5.1702
hour 11
weather Calm
expect shown vpfuelacid
walk -25 -69.6 to -17 -69.4 below=14
picture vp_acid_sign -20 8 -67 -16 6.4 -68.2 light=20
read FUEL WORKS - SIDE GALLERY
walk -18 -69.4 to -20 -66 to -22.6 -61.8
wait 8
expect message spilt fuel salts
expect hurt 10
walk -22.6 -61.8 to -20 -66 to -18 -69.4 to -25 -69.6
wait 2
expect hurt 1
